#!/usr/bin/env bash
set -euo pipefail

ROOT="$(cd "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")/.." && pwd)"
OUT_DIR="$ROOT/performance-reviews"
mkdir -p "$OUT_DIR"

SYSTEM="${*:-system}"
SLUG="$(printf '%s' "$SYSTEM" | tr '[:upper:]' '[:lower:]' | tr -cs 'a-z0-9' '-' | sed 's/^-//; s/-$//; s/--*/-/g')"
if [ -z "$SLUG" ]; then
  SLUG="system"
fi

STAMP="$(date '+%Y%m%d-%H%M%S')"
OUT="$OUT_DIR/$STAMP-$SLUG-performance-review.md"

cat > "$OUT" <<MD
# Performance Review: $SYSTEM

Generated: $(date '+%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S%z')

## Scope

- System reviewed:
- Date range:
- Entry count:
- Decision this review informs:

## Entry Schema

- Date:
- Setup / type / channel:
- Planned action:
- Actual action:
- Outcome:
- Notes:

## Segment Performance

| Segment | Entries | Wins / Successes | Losses / Failures | Rate | Avg Outcome | Note |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
|  |  |  |  |  |  |  |

## Planned Vs Actual

- Planned reward / cost / effort:
- Actual reward / cost / effort:
- Execution gap:
- Primary drift:

## Streak And Drawdown

- Current streak:
- Longest adverse streak:
- Recovery time:
- Recent-window trend:
- Baseline probability:

## Classification

- Noise:
- Execution gap:
- Structural flaw:
- Thesis-breaker:
- Classification:

## Edge Health

- Healthy / decaying / critical:
- Evidence:
- Confidence:

## Prescribed Action

- Continue / reduce / quarantine / stop / gather data:
- Circuit breaker needed?:
- Reason:

## Next Slice

- Next safe action:
- Verification:
MD

printf '%s\n' "$OUT"
